    "title": "Trinity Audio -a world of audio experiences for your readers",
    "introHtml": "<p>As SPARK design agency, we partnered with Viridix, an agritech company, in 2022 to develop a user-centered precision irrigation system powered by real-time soil moisture sensors and optimized for UX/UI. Our innovative solution helps growers save water, increase crop yields, and improve profits.</p>",
