    {
      "type": "split",
      "html": "<h2>Improving conversion with better affordance</h2><p>We helped Trinity Audio Improve their conversion by 24% ,  our first focus was changing the affordance of the button raising conversion by 8%.</p><p>We added a call to action Don’t have time to read? listen instead explaining the value proposition.</p>",
